WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.620
The clock starts.

2
00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:05.360
One paper, an hour and
a half, two sections.

3
00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.750
In Section B, some answers
are worth 10 marks,

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.520
and the quality of your
writing is marked too.

5
00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:12.920
Think of a car.

6
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:17.110
You pull away in a low gear,
then change up to travel further.

7
00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:22.940
So in this exam, how do you change gear
between short answers and longer writing?

8
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:26.690
In this mission, you'll sort
command words into two kinds:

9
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.700
knowledge, and judgement.

10
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.890
Then you'll weigh up a famous
argument about a watch,

11
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.730
a watchmaker and the order of nature.

12
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:40.120
Your mission: find out how to change gear
between short answers and longer writing.
